Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The door opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Footsteps cross the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You try to move—nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the mattress sinks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This happened to David
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hufford before he became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a folklorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Years later, in Newfoundland,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,strangers described the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,sequence and gave the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,visitor a name he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,said he had never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,heard:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Old Hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,REM physiology can explain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,why awareness returns while
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the muscles are still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,held quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But Hufford's puzzle begins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,after that:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why the footsteps, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,weight, the certainty of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,intention—and why the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,shape in other lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does folklore teach us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,what to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do recurring encounters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,teach folklore what to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The full investigation is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Which came first:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the legend—or the encounter?
